INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `blog_category_id`, `blog_name`, `blog_description`, `blog_image`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(5, 1, 'Best Car in Bangladesh: Top Models for Value and Comfort', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d259d2a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d259d2a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Buying\n a functional and valuable car in Bangladesh is important as the price \nof cars in Bangladesh is relatively higher than in many other Asian \ncountries. You want to choose the best car in Bangladesh&nbsp;based on your \nbudget, primary use purpose, fuel efficiency, lifestyle, safety \nfeatures, etc. Plus, you want to select a car that can withstand strong \nimpacts and cause minimal accidental damage. In this article, we will \nhelp you choose a decent vehicle in different categories.</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-82dc1f9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"82dc1f9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Best Budget Car In Bangladesh</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-92a5817 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"92a5817\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Petrolheads who prefer significant cost savings will look for <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/lowest-price-cars-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>budget-friendly cars</strong> </a>without compromising quality and performance. One of the primary reasons to <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/car-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>buy affordable vehicles</strong></a>\n is that they are less expensive to maintain and repair. Plus, you will \nsave money on license and registration fees as well as cheaper \ninsurance. &nbsp;Also, car enthusiasts will have to worry less about the \ndepreciation value of the car.</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9424ee4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"9424ee4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"666\" height=\"375\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/2022-toyota-aqua-brass_gold.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-5615\" alt=\"2022 toyota aqua brass price in bangladesh\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f49b2e0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f49b2e0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">01. Toyota Aqua</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2225373 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2225373\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>If you want to enjoy smooth riding with easy maneuverability, <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/toyota-aqua-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Toyota Aqua is a perfect choice</strong></a>.\n This mini sedan has a decent initial torque to revive hard the engine. \nBesides, it is one of the most fuel-efficient vehicles. Its average fuel\n economy is around 22-25 km per liter. This hybrid electric subcompact \ncar is equipped with a smooth engine and linear acceleration to enjoy \npeppy driving. &nbsp;Commuters and small families love this car due to its \naffordable price tag. The cost of a Toyota Aqua can be anywhere between \n12-22.5 lakhs depending on the variant, model, year, etc.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Aqua 2016</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>12-14 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Aqua 2017</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>13-15 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Aqua 2018</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>15.5-17.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/listings/toyota-aqua-s-hybrid-2019/\"><strong>Toyota Aqua 2019</strong></a></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>17.5 -19.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Aqua 2020</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>19 -21 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Aqua 2021</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>20.5 -22.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Aqua 2022</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>20.5 -22.5 lakhs</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0885377 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"0885377\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"595\" height=\"349\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Toyota_Axio_hybrid_Super_White.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-5659\" alt=\"Toyota_Axio_hybrid_Super_White\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a61b2d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a61b2d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">02. Toyota Axio</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b496599 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b496599\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>If you are looking for an easy-handling vehicle at a reasonable price, you can’t go wrong with a <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/toyota-axio-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Toyota Axio</strong></a>.\n This small-sized passenger car is perfect for a busy city like Dhaka as\n it can effortlessly cut through spaces. It is a perfect choice for \nsingles and small families. Budget-oriented people whose choices are \ntight will surely love this best car in Bangladesh under 20 lakhs. The \nprice of Toyota Axio ranges from 18 to 31 lakhs. &nbsp;The vehicle has also a\n high resale value with minimal loss. Plus, it has a low refinement \nlevel including transmission noise, shaking, and vibration.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Axio 2017</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>18-23 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/listings/toyota-axio-x-non-hybrid-2018-silver/\">Toyota Axio 2018</a></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>20.5-25 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/listings/toyota-axio-x-black-2019/\">Toyota Axio 2019</a></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>23.5 -27.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Axio 2020</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>24.5 -27.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Axio 2021</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>25.5 -28.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Axio 2022</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>25.5 -28.5 lakhs</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf323f2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bf323f2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Best Mileage Car In Bangladesh</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c511ee elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5c511ee\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>The\n primary benefits of high mileage vehicles are consistence performance \nin the long run and longer lifespans. Moreover, fuel-efficient cars \ncause less greenhouse gases and decrease smog and pollution \nsignificantly. &nbsp;It will also lead to minimal damage to the moving parts \nof the vehicle. Apart from saving costs, you are also causing minimal \nharm to the environment.</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-93af0a5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"93af0a5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">01. Toyota Corolla</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-76eb0f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"76eb0f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/0208422A30240822W00111.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-17067\" alt=\"Pearl White Toyota Corolla Cross Z 2021 Leather Hybrid\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d07b24d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d07b24d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>When it comes to fuel efficiency, the <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/toyota-corolla-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Toyota Corolla is a top choice</strong></a>.\n Its engine runs on the Atkinson cycle. This increases the expansion \nratio notably more than the compression ratio. The maximum mileage of \nthe <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/listings/toyota-corolla-hybrid-wxb-2019/\"><strong>Toyota Corolla Hybrid</strong></a>\n is up to 50 mpg combined. Car enthusiasts love this vehicle due to its \nsafety features, connectivity, cargo space, and smooth ride comfort. \nMoreover, this dependable vehicle has low maintenance issues. Hence, you\n won’t have to worry about major problems and frequent repairs. \n&nbsp;According to IIHS, it has also excellent safe driving capability.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Corolla 2019</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>28 -30 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Corolla 2020</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>31 -35 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Corolla 2021</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>36 -39 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Corolla 2022</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>37 -40 lakhs</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6c38eb9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6c38eb9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/TOYOTA-ALLION-A-15-G-2019-4.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15667\" alt=\"Black Toyota Allion A15 G 2019\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17ebbe2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"17ebbe2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">02. Toyota Allion</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-577bbba elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"577bbba\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>If you want to replace your regular sporty vehicles for better fuel consumption purposes, the <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/allion-car-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Toyota Allion appears perfect</strong></a>.\n The average fuel consumption of this best car in Bangladesh under 20 \nlakhs&nbsp;is around 13-14 kmpl. But it may slightly vary depending on the \nmodel, fuel type, driving style, and transmission. Plus, this reliable \nand dependable compact sedan is a good choice for economy mode driving.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Allion 2016</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>24 -28.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Allion 2017</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>26 -31 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Allion 2018</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>29 -33 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Allion 2019</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>30 -34 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Allion 2020</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>31.5 -36 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Allion 2021</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>33.5 -37.5 lakhs</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-94f22ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"94f22ed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Best Selling Car in Bangladesh</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0f881a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e0f881a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>Some\n cars are sold in higher units globally compared to others. These \nvehicles become highly popular for several reasons, such as build \nquality, durability, ease of repair, availability of parts, ease of \ndrive, performance, etc. &nbsp;Besides, these vehicles have the best warranty\n programs and excellent resale value. In Bangladesh, there are some \nhighest-selling vehicles that contribute to a decent car market.</p></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42e98ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"42e98ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/TOYOTA-NOAH-G-2022-WHITE-1.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-13104\" alt=\"Toyota Noah g 2022 pearl Cars for Sale\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2dc1809 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2dc1809\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">01. Toyota Noah</h3></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e77507d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e77507d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p><a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/noah-car-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>Toyota Noah</strong></a>\n is one of the highest-selling cars in Bangladesh. Car lovers prefer \nthis vehicle due to its hybrid technology, budget-friendly price, and \neasy-to-get spare parts. This ultimate people mover has earned a decent \nreputation for long-term dependability. You can expect this vehicle to \nlast about 10 – 15 years and around 150,000 – 200,000 miles easily. Car \nenthusiasts can use this multi-purpose car for large families and \nbusiness purposes. It accommodates 7-8 passengers easily. The car has \nalso an excellent fuel-efficient system, consuming only 20 to 25 \nkilometers per liter of petrol.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Noah 2017</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>23.5 -29.5 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Noah 2018</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>27.5 -33 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Noah 2019</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>28.5 -35 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Noah 2020</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>38.5 -39 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Noah 2021</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>42 -44 lakhs</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"254\"><p>Toyota Noah 2022</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>49 -52 lakhs</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e786e1e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e786e1e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://cartheorybd.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/TOYOTA-LAND-CRUISER-PRADO-TX-L-PACKAGE-70TH-ANNIVERSARY-LIMITED-1.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15701\" alt=\"Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2021 70th Anniversary\"></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d7d83c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7d7d83c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">02. Toyota Land Cruiser Prado</h3></div></div><p>When it comes to off-road capable SUVs, Toyota Land Cruiser Prado is one of the best choices. This <a href=\"https://cartheorybd.com/prado-car-price-in-bangladesh/\"><strong>top-selling vehicle</strong></a>\n offers excellent handling and stability even on the toughest terrain. \nCar enthusiasts who are looking for an extremely durable SUV will surely\n love this vehicle. It can easily provide 25 years of service as the \nunit is equipped with expensive and durable components. &nbsp;Its average \nfuel consumption is 13.50 kmpl for highway driving and 10.50 kmpl for \ncity driving. Besides, this Full-size SUV has a large cargo space to \ntake more people and can carry more luggage.</p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"360\"><p><strong>Car Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"254\"><p><strong>Price</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"360\"><p>Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2017</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>1 -1.17 Crore</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"360\"><p>Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2018</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>1.20 -1.30 Crore</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"360\"><p>Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2019</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>1.30 -1.40 Crore</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"360\"><p>Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2020</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>1.35 -1.45 Crore</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"360\"><p>Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2021</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>1.45 -1.75 Crore</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"360\"><p>Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2022</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>1.52 -1.85 Crore</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"360\"><p>Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 2022</p></td><td width=\"254\"><p>1.54 -1.90 </p></td></tr></tbody></table>', 'best-car-in-bangladesh_1734871249.jpg', 1, '2024-12-15 18:52:50', '2024-12-22 18:40:49');
